---
// Componente de Apresentação Comercial da Plataforma do Aluno
// Apresenta as 6 telas reais da plataforma com imagens autênticas e botões funcionais de conversão.
---

<div id="plataforma-tour" class="editorial-card overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-white shadow-2xl rounded-2xl">
  
  <!-- BARRA DE CONTROLE / HEADER DO SHOWCASE -->
  <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-400/30 text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Ambiente Real do Aluno</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          A Plataforma por Dentro: Simples, Organizada e Estimulante
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Sem bagunça e sem vídeos dispersos. Tudo foi planejado para você saber exatamente o que estudar em 20 minutos por dia e acelerar sua fluência até 3x mais rápido.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="#planos"
          class="btn-editorial-primary !py-3 !px-5 !text-xs !bg-blue-600 hover:!bg-blue-500 !text-white flex items-center gap-2 shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/30"
        >
          <span>Garantir Meu Acesso</span>
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ABAS NAVEGÁVEIS DOS 6 MÓDULOS CENTRAIS -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2 scrollbar-none border-b border-slate-800/80" role="tablist">
      
      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        data-tour-tab="dashboard"
        class="tour-nav-btn active px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-blue-600/30 border border-blue-500/50 flex items-center gap-2 transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        aria-selected="true"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
        </svg>
        <span>1. Dashboard Diário</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        data-tour-tab="courses"
        class="tour-nav-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-white/5 border border-transparent flex items-center gap-2 transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
        </svg>
        <span>2. Trilhas & Aulas Práticas</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        data-tour-tab="vocabulary"
        class="tour-nav-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-white/5 border border-transparent flex items-center gap-2 transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
        </svg>
        <span>3. Vocabulário & Revisão SRS</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        data-tour-tab="masterclasses"
        class="tour-nav-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-white/5 border border-transparent flex items-center gap-2 transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
        <span>4. Aulas ao Vivo (Quartas)</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        data-tour-tab="vivencia"
        class="tour-nav-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-white/5 border border-transparent flex items-center gap-2 transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 4v16M17 4v16M3 8h4m10 0h4M3 12h18M3 16h4m10 0h4M4 20h16a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v14a1 1 0 001 1z" />
        </svg>
        <span>5. Séries & Vivência Real</span>
      </button>

      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        data-tour-tab="sos"
        class="tour-nav-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 hover:bg-white/5 border border-transparent flex items-center gap-2 transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        aria-selected="false"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
        </svg>
        <span>6. Canal SOS com Amanda</span>
      </button>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CONTEÚDO DOS PAINÉIS DO TOUR -->
  <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 bg-[#090d16]">
    
    <!-- PAINEL 1: DASHBOARD -->
    <div id="tour-panel-dashboard" class="tour-panel block">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl relative group">
            <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-white/5">
              <img
                src="/images/platform/dashboard.png"
                alt="Dashboard da Plataforma do Aluno Fluente no Mundo"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
                loading="eager"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Tela oficial do aluno: Mapa de Foco e Rotina</span>
              <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold font-mono">Dose diária: 20 min</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">
            Módulo 01 · Organização Total
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Chega de perder tempo procurando o que estudar.
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Ao abrir a plataforma, o seu dia já está pronto. Você assiste à aula direcionada, realiza os exercícios práticos de fala e segue a vida sabendo exatamente que evoluiu hoje.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Cronograma Unificado:</strong> Metas claras de Segunda a Domingo.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Polyglot Check & Streak:</strong> Hábitos sustentáveis sem pressão punitiva.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Certificado Trimestral:</strong> Comprove carga horária a cada 3 meses.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="#planos" class="btn-editorial-primary !text-xs !py-3 !px-5 text-center">
              Quero Acesso a Esta Rotina &rarr;
            </a>
            <a href="/formacao-global" class="btn-editorial-secondary !text-xs !py-3 !px-4 text-center !bg-white/10 !border-white/20 !text-white hover:!bg-white/20">
              Ver Grade Curricular
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAINEL 2: COURSES -->
    <div id="tour-panel-courses" class="tour-panel hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl relative group">
            <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-white/5">
              <img
                src="/images/platform/courses.png"
                alt="Grade de Cursos e Formações"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Trilhas de Pronúncia, Viagens, Expressões e Base</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold font-mono">100% Gravadas em HD</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">
            Módulo 02 · Aprendizado Estruturado
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Do absoluto zero à fala fluida e articulada.
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Aulas fundamentadas no Método A.U.T.E.N.T.I.C.A e nos 4Ps biomecânicos. Você aprende a posicionar os lábios, língua e respiração para produzir os sons do inglês nativo sem travar.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Formações Essenciais:</strong> A base indispensável para quem quer falar rápido.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Treino dos 4Ps:</strong> Padrões fonéticos, Pronúncia, Psicológico e Prática.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Materiais de Apoio:</strong> Ebooks e resumos para baixar e guardar.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="#planos" class="btn-editorial-primary !text-xs !py-3 !px-5 text-center">
              Matricular e Liberar Todas as Aulas &rarr;
            </a>
            <a href="/metodo" class="btn-editorial-secondary !text-xs !py-3 !px-4 text-center !bg-white/10 !border-white/20 !text-white hover:!bg-white/20">
              Conhecer os 9 Pilares
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAINEL 3: VOCABULARY & REVISÃO SRS -->
    <div id="tour-panel-vocabulary" class="tour-panel hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl relative group">
            <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-white/5">
              <img
                src="/images/platform/vocabulary.png"
                alt="Banco de Vocabulário e Revisão Espaçada SRS"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Algoritmo Inteligente de Memória Ativa (SRS)</span>
              <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold font-mono">Meta: 20.000 Expressões</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono">
            Módulo 03 · Memória de Longo Prazo
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Nunca mais esqueça as palavras que você aprendeu.
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            O cérebro humano esquece 80% do que estuda em menos de 48h se não for estimulado na hora certa. Nosso algoritmo agenda revisões inteligentes em 3 etapas (Ouvir, Pronunciar e Traduzir no Contexto) para fixar na memória permanente.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Fim da Decoreba:</strong> Aprenda expressões completas em contexto real.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Ciclo em 3 Etapas:</strong> Treina audição nativa, fala ativa e interpretação.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Banco Pessoal:</strong> Adicione novas expressões das suas séries e viagens.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-4">
            <a href="#planos" class="btn-editorial-primary !text-xs !py-3 !px-5 text-center">
              Experimentar o Sistema de Vocabulário &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAINEL 4: MASTERCLASSES -->
    <div id="tour-panel-masterclasses" class="tour-panel hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl relative group">
            <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-white/5">
              <img
                src="/images/platform/masterclasses.png"
                alt="Aulas ao Vivo de Quarta-feira"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Toda Quarta às 20h com a Prof. Amanda Beatriz</span>
              <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono">100% Interativa</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono">
            Módulo 04 · Contato Humano Real
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Você não estuda sozinho. Toda quarta temos aula ao vivo.
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Nada substitui a mentoria humana. Nas quartas-feiras às 20h, Amanda entra ao vivo com a turma para praticar pronúncia, corrigir vícios de fala, responder dúvidas e treinar conversação prática.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Correção Imediata:</strong> Tire travas fonéticas diretamente com a professora.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Gravações Disponíveis:</strong> Não pôde assistir? Assista gravado quando puder.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>Comunidade Estimulante:</strong> Interaja com alunos que têm o mesmo objetivo.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="#planos" class="btn-editorial-primary !text-xs !py-3 !px-5 text-center">
              Participar da Próxima Aula ao Vivo &rarr;
            </a>
            <a href="/imersao" class="btn-editorial-secondary !text-xs !py-3 !px-4 text-center !bg-white/10 !border-white/20 !text-white hover:!bg-white/20">
              Ver Detalhes da Imersão
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PAINEL 5: VIVENCIA GLOBAL & SÉRIES -->
    <div id="tour-panel-vivencia" class="tour-panel hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="p-2 sm:p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl relative group">
            <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-white/5">
              <img
                src="/images/platform/vivencia.png"
                alt="Módulo de Vivência Global e Séries"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Cultura, Filmes, Músicas e Expressões do Cotidiano</span>
              <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold font-mono">Inglês da Vida Real</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
            Módulo 05 · Aculturamento Real
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-white">
            Aprenda o inglês que os nativos realmente usam na rua.
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Livros didáticos ensinam frases robóticas que ninguém fala no aeroporto de Londres ou numa cafeteria em Nova York. No Vivência Global, você aprende gírias, ritmo natural e entende filmes sem depender da legenda.
